      * COMP-5 = native binary, full storage range
       01  COMP5-REC.
           05  N-HALF-U           PIC 9(4)   COMP-5.
           05  N-HALF-S           PIC S9(4)  COMP-5.
           05  N-FULL-U           PIC 9(9)   COMP-5.
           05  N-FULL-S           PIC S9(9)  COMP-5.
           05  N-DBL-S            PIC S9(18) COMP-5.
           05  N-DBL-U            PIC 9(18)  COMP-5.
           05  N-SCALED           PIC S9(5)V99 COMPUTATIONAL-5.
